{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"command_execution","command":"/opt/homebrew/bin/zsh -lc \"rg -n 'D737|D736|D735' docs/DECISIONS.md docs/DECISIONS-log.md\"","aggregated_output":"docs/DECISIONS.md:1079:| D735 | 2026-11-22 | (superseded by D737) Council 49–50: the v13 repair is finished to a line (at most two more review rounds: wording and cases, then the sent request and checks; then the blind test once; a serious issue after the second goes back to Alex); shrinking to six checks set aside (drops C8's segment-into-total guard; exceeds D734); design v2 | superseded by D737 | `docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/REPAIR-DESIGN.md` |\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:1080:| D736 | 2026-11-22 | Council 51: v2 wording review finds as many serious issues as round 49 (unstated C1–C9 rules, counterexamples to every check change, readers grading only refusals); Codex: fix and use the last round; Claude: back to Alex now (one mechanism, round after round); goes to Alex | in force | `docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/codex-r51.md` |\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:1081:| D737 | 2026-11-22 | Alex: shrink judging-v13's format — code refuses only five defects (number misread, wrong arithmetic, part above or added into its whole, two forecasts of one quarter, own estimate as the market's) and broken structure, each rule in one or two sentences beside its field; the rest shown to readers; council within that scope; then the $0 blind test; supersedes D735's full restatement | in force | `docs/DECISIONS-log.md` |\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11185:## D735 · 2026-11-22 · Council rounds 49–50: the repair is finished to a line; at most two more review rounds, then the blind test\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11210:## D736 · 2026-11-22 · Council round 51: the repair's wording review finds as many serious issues as round 49; Claude and Codex split on going back to Alex now\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11230:  - **Codex:** fix the round-51 issues, use the second allowed round (D735) on the sent request and checks, and return to Alex only\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11232:  - **Claude:** go back to Alex now. Round 51's evidence came after D735's consensus. Shrinking the checks is the structural rule,\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11236:## D737 · 2026-11-22 · Alex: shrink judging-v13's format to the checks that stop the named defects, then a $0 blind test\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11238:- **The question** (after D736): \"判数字新版本的修补连续三轮审查都在冒新规则（填写说明将从 1 万字涨到约 2 万字，每个答案约 16 个数、每个数要同时满足几十条规则）。Codex 主张修完再审最后一轮；我主张现在改结构。下一步怎么走？\"\ndocs/DECISIONS-log.md:11256:- **Superseded:** REPAIR-DESIGN.md v2's full restatement (D735's finish line), replaced by the small format.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
